    "created_at": "2018-10-16T23:53:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-10-16T23:53:37Z",
    "body": "I'd like to assume ```<option>``` and ```<optgroup>``` just provide the owner ```<select>``` with data, they don't create CSS boxes, and they don't support almost all CSS styling including generated contents.\r\n",
